abstract: >
  Bukifon is an open-source desktop synthesizer and sampler platform with a 3D-printed
  380x210x63 mm enclosure, 42 Lapka-42 keys, 16 encoders, a 5-inch 800x480 display,
  10 mini-jacks and two 60 mm faders. KiCad schematics (CERN-OHL-S-2.0), C++ firmware
  (GPL-3.0-or-later), parametric mechanics and open module SDK.
